1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,867
4:44. The phone on the shelf doesn't
ring. Not once.

2
00:00:04,367 --> 00:00:10,867
Instead the speaker in the ceiling
crackles. The same speaker that
carries the 6:40 report to every room
in town.

3
00:00:11,367 --> 00:00:13,167
Rosa. Rosa, wake up. It's me.

4
00:00:13,667 --> 00:00:16,833
It's my voice. My rasp. My exact way
of saying her name.

5
00:00:17,333 --> 00:00:21,067
I'm at the old exchange. Past the
wall. I can't breathe. Please come.

6
00:00:21,567 --> 00:00:25,900
Rule seven. The more it sounds like
someone you love, the less you trust
it.
